1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,300
Your phone knows everything about your day.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
You don't.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,800
What actually happened today?

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,900
Dawnward asks one real question each evening.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,500
And listens.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,300
Kept. October 24.

7
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,700
Each morning, three quiet moves, drawn from your own words.

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,600
No streaks. No scores.

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,400
And slowly, something you've never had.

10
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,100
A picture of your life you can travel.

11
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,300
Watch your worlds change, as you do.

12
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,800
It remembers who you're becoming. Even on the days you forget.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Dawnward.

14
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,300
Become who you are becoming. Coming soon.
